{"title":"Bikepacking Roots X Ocean & San Shirts Now Available","link":"https://theradavist.com/bikepacking-roots-x-ocean-san","date":1795540088000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/bikepacking-roots\" target=\"_blank\">Bikepacking Roots</a> has teamed up with Los Angeles-based Ocean &amp; San to celebrate their shared love of outdoors and the Slow by Nature motto. Bikepacking Roots’ Community Program Manager Danielle Parnes created this fun new design highlighting Bikepacking Roots’ 3 Pillars:</p>\n<p><em>Ride, Connect and Protect.</em></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/a0f5ad2607ccdf3187286bab2e24d9d60a4ccd21c72cec20d71f669a94952555.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/8a1a63e5d975b99f63d442eb208d9bc9335771c59512291a4c56e553ad08580e.jpg 640w, /media/a0f5ad2607ccdf3187286bab2e24d9d60a4ccd21c72cec20d71f669a94952555.jpg 1800w, /media/f935b20e3532f78e1ba87353d2fd14a6451031c753ce5e83ace0fa58b1f825b4.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The All Day Shirts offer the comfort and style of a casual shirt, with the performance and functionality of a traditional cycling jersey. Each shirt is patterned, cut, and sewn in the US.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/1b2d4c42461ae33a75553da58a721bb288ebdbf178fbe6eafe8d9a2bfc89fccd.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/fc12dd779dede7d4f0816484fb04a61b91babef041484360c621e3c29dc32bfd.jpg 800w, /media/63d198e1cc14ea8b7725bfde0d8d13449ecdbc2bde4a0fc8474770ab14810c34.jpg 1600w, /media/1b2d4c42461ae33a75553da58a721bb288ebdbf178fbe6eafe8d9a2bfc89fccd.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/30f8c59e164a294d72bb34ba2bc83c070d702d22953f7c2ade6fbb8664a86b7e.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/feab84407c9219458d8d28b8cfaf11754f6c270fa7107a48daf597b1876d19d2.jpg 800w, /media/21bd31b8eec1e2ed19d450b07e6fb8fa8612329a3dc81dfbf5984024bf8de079.jpg 1600w, /media/30f8c59e164a294d72bb34ba2bc83c070d702d22953f7c2ade6fbb8664a86b7e.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>These shirts are available for a limited time only via presale so you can get your favorite color, size &amp; fit! Proceeds will help support Bikepacking Roots route development, community building and public lands advocacy work.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/ee32c32e98bc29dec41a90c4c237eac49850d5a31f98aeacb4a926ffc5d69dd1.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/2b14456700b81e09f3dc1c2233ad0d6ef35658d94cfb9b977e883e8540f882cb.jpg 800w, /media/ee32c32e98bc29dec41a90c4c237eac49850d5a31f98aeacb4a926ffc5d69dd1.jpg 1600w, /media/d056f89653100ee5b2e6a3b7b96d7a9524233a863e2b15b43497d77db2ea2597.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e7405ef0c52144ef52954c4433eb4a462f8fc7538e0d260ea042015ecf0e47c6.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5b877d28c98067bcad090b3f645cddce90af45c00bbdf0c1349fa123d2c009a3.jpg 800w, /media/e7405ef0c52144ef52954c4433eb4a462f8fc7538e0d260ea042015ecf0e47c6.jpg 1600w, /media/ad529b9c6a58a0407323547933e03771b432105ae83862c7438b93a103307ee8.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/bc80f280e44d2c98fa1dcc293251484d6701a74789d869606fd54abd64386c40.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/d0bae07001a28690d7014e7c5ae92080e911bf2dc4c66256bea22a03a60fd6c1.jpg 800w, /media/bc80f280e44d2c98fa1dcc293251484d6701a74789d869606fd54abd64386c40.jpg 1600w, /media/fda90753c7c133083dabec88ddd08ccc53cda1c27b2624c2c37de2dc2e3a871c.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bikepackingroots.org/product/ocean-san-all-day-shirt/\" target=\"_blank\">Order now</a> as some size and color combos are limited! Orders are open through Sunday December 6th.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/bikepacking-roots-x-ocean-san\">Bikepacking Roots X Ocean &amp; San Shirts Now Available</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"spencer harding","comments":"https://theradavist.com/bikepacking-roots-x-ocean-san#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"51806a5d7f74c1b955a8895b140f05f5e8f961e04d0a74315e71343ca4db9811","category":"Cycling"}